{"mode":"words","text":"Fent láthatod a szöveget pontosan úgy, ahogyan az alkalmazás megjeleníti. Minden szó egy kis kártya: felül a szó a célnyelven, alatta a jelentése az anyanyelveden — szóról szóra, a célnyelv sorrendjében. Alatta pedig a teljes mondat folyékony fordításban szerepel. Azoknál a nyelveknél, amelyek más írásrendszerrel rendelkeznek, egy sor transzkripció is megjelenik, hogy mindent el tudd olvasni. Érints meg egy szót: a hang pontosan onnan folytatja a lejátszást.","words":[{"s":0,"e":290},{"s":337,"e":743},{"s":778,"e":801},{"s":824,"e":1231},{"s":1289,"e":1730},{"s":1823,"e":2241},{"s":2357,"e":2624},{"s":2670,"e":2740},{"s":2821,"e":3413},{"s":3495,"e":4389},{"s":4760,"e":5097},{"s":5155,"e":5352},{"s":5422,"e":5526},{"s":5561,"e":5712},{"s":5770,"e":6432},{"s":6803,"e":7105},{"s":7152,"e":7175},{"s":7233,"e":7430},{"s":7500,"e":7523},{"s":7581,"e":8464},{"s":8580,"e":9091},{"s":9172,"e":9242},{"s":9300,"e":9880},{"s":9938,"e":10042},{"s":10112,"e":10867},{"s":11018,"e":11157},{"s":11331,"e":11726},{"s":11772,"e":12179},{"s":12225,"e":12306},{"s":12376,"e":12887},{"s":12957,"e":13885},{"s":14315,"e":14733},{"s":14779,"e":15000},{"s":15046,"e":15070},{"s":15139,"e":15464},{"s":15522,"e":15801},{"s":15859,"e":16300},{"s":16335,"e":16985},{"s":17032,"e":17751},{"s":18181,"e":18669},{"s":18727,"e":18750},{"s":18785,"e":19574},{"s":19690,"e":20027},{"s":20097,"e":20340},{"s":20422,"e":21211},{"s":21258,"e":22082},{"s":22117,"e":22268},{"s":22314,"e":22535},{"s":22616,"e":23371},{"s":23406,"e":23487},{"s":23556,"e":24299},{"s":24474,"e":24636},{"s":24694,"e":25124},{"s":25240,"e":25437},{"s":25507,"e":25762},{"s":25878,"e":26691},{"s":27063,"e":27446},{"s":27504,"e":27632},{"s":27678,"e":27759},{"s":27806,"e":28363},{"s":28537,"e":28618},{"s":28700,"e":28874},{"s":28955,"e":29501},{"s":29617,"e":29895},{"s":29942,"e":30395},{"s":30430,"e":30453},{"s":30499,"e":31579}]}